   "outcome_text": "root cause: Hurdle shape disabled + layer 2 vs mask 1 + player collision exception, so no contact.\npatch: reset_to_spawn now removes exception and restores Hurdle layer 1 with shape enabled.\nwhy it satisfies: walking capsule collides with 0.55m wall and stops, E stays negative.\n",
